              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SneakyOkra2503"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Definitely will be making again! They turned out great!! I made a couple small tweaks, dark brown sugar instead of granulated for the outside added a richness to the overall flavor. They also baked for closer to 12-14 minutes total and came out crispy on the outer layer but soft on the inside",
            "datePublished": "2024-02-05T06:05:06.257Z"
