            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dinosammy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great every single time....These cookies are suppose to be flat /chewy and not cake like...I put the dough in the fridge for an hour for easier handling...I dipped the scoop in the cinnamon sugar every time before scooping the next cookie , no sticky hands or scoop..I make these every week for lunches",
